{"seq":16,"slug":"accessibility-i18n","title":"无障碍与国际化","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":5,"docCount":21,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 无障碍与国际化 简介\n\n无障碍与国际化是构建面向全球用户的 Web 应用不可或缺的两大工程能力。无障碍确保残障用户能够平等地使用 Web 产品，国际化则让应用能够适配不同语言和文化背景的用户群体。这两个领域虽然关注点不同，但在工程实践中高度交叉，共同构成了现代前端开发中的\"包容性工程\"。\n\n本知识库适用于具备前端开发基础的中高级工程师，包括负责产品无障碍合规的前端开发者、需要构建多语言应用的国际化工程师，以及关注用户体验和产品质量的技术负责人。\n\n全书共分为四章，前两章聚焦无障碍，后两章聚焦国际化，形成完整的包容性工程知识体系。\n\n第一章**Web 无障碍**，系统讲解 Web 无障碍的核心原则与实践基础，涵盖 WCAG 标准的理解与应用、语义化 HTML 的正确使用、键盘导航的实现方法，以及屏幕阅读器的工作原理与适配策略。\n\n第二章**ARIA 与测试**，深入讲解 WAI-ARIA 规范的核心概念与使用方法，以及无障碍测试的工具链和自动化检测方案，帮助读者在开发流程中系统化地保障无障碍质量。\n\n第三章**国际化基础**，建立前端国际化的技术基础，涵盖国际化架构设计、语言区域与数据格式化、双向文本处理，以及 Unicode 编码的深层理解，帮助读者掌握国际化开发的底层知识。\n\n第四章**国际化工程**，聚焦国际化的工程化实践，涵盖翻译工作流的设计与管理、国际化测试策略，以及国际化场景下的性能优化方案，帮助读者在团队协作中高效推进多语言产品的开发与交付。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章和第二章完整学习无障碍知识体系，再通过第三章和第四章系统掌握国际化工程能力。两个方向也可以独立学习，根据实际项目需求选择优先深入的方向。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"web-accessibility","title":"Web 无障碍","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wcag-principles","title":"WCAG 原则与标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility/wcag-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"semantic-html","title":"语义化 HTML","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility/semantic-html"},{"seq":3,"slug":"keyboard-navigation","title":"键盘导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility/keyboard-navigation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"screen-reader","title":"屏幕阅读器适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility/screen-reader"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"aria-and-testing","title":"ARIA 与测试","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/aria-and-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aria-fundamentals","title":"ARIA 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/aria-and-testing/aria-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"accessibility-testing","title":"无障碍测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/aria-and-testing/accessibility-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"accessibility-automation","title":"无障碍自动化工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/aria-and-testing/accessibility-automation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"i18n-fundamentals","title":"国际化基础","docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"i18n-architecture","title":"i18n 架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/i18n-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"locale-and-formatting","title":"地区与格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/locale-and-formatting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"react-i18n","title":"React i18n 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/react-i18n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"l10n-testing","title":"本地化测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/l10n-testing"},{"seq":5,"slug":"text-formatting","title":"文本与消息格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/text-formatting"},{"seq":6,"slug":"rtl-layout","title":"RTL 布局适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/rtl-layout"},{"seq":7,"slug":"text-direction","title":"文本方向与双向文本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/text-direction"},{"seq":8,"slug":"unicode-and-encoding","title":"Unicode 与字符编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/unicode-and-encoding"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-i18n","title":"高级国际化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/advanced-i18n","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rtl-layout","title":"RTL 布局适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/advanced-i18n/rtl-layout"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-content","title":"动态内容本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/advanced-i18n/dynamic-content"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-deployment","title":"性能优化与多地区部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/advanced-i18n/performance-deployment"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"i18n-engineering","title":"国际化工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-workflow","title":"翻译工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-engineering/translation-workflow"},{"seq":2,"slug":"i18n-testing","title":"i18n 测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-engineering/i18n-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"i18n-performance","title":"i18n 性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-engineering/i18n-performance"}]}]}